1
00:00:03,415 --> 00:00:06,091
Story mode expands a narrative concept

2
00:00:06,091 --> 00:00:08,559
into a sequence of distinct shots.

3
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:11,259
Set the number of beats and their duration,

4
00:00:11,259 --> 00:00:13,930
then suggest the framing you want to include.

5
00:00:14,257 --> 00:00:18,634
Shared character and world details help the sequence stay connected,

6
00:00:18,634 --> 00:00:21,649
while each beat has its own action and composition.
